Subject: [PATCH 018/140] feat(player): match mpvRex overlay indicator behavior

Keep overlay indicators at mpvRx's existing tuned position while player controls are visible, then smoothly glide them toward the top when the controls hide. Slim the indicator pill without touching the surrounding player-control constraints or spacing, and keep the hold-speed indicator as a compact animated text-only speed readout.

Behavior adapted from mpvRex.

Co-authored-by: sfsakhawat999 <75839432+sfsakhawat999@users.noreply.github.com>
---
